#. +> trunk
#: src/win.py:657
msgid ""
"<html><b>Welcome to the ATI GPU Monitor (KAtiMon)</b><br/>"
"<br/>"
"This is a KDE program for monitoring and controlling some aspects of your ATI graphics card.<br/>"
"You can access KAtiMon by clicking on its system tray icon.<br/>"
"<br/>"
"<u>Note that this program is NOT developed by ATI/AMD: please do not send them any bug reports.</u><br/>"
"</html>"
msgstr ""
"<html><b>Willkamen bi den Kieker för ATI-GPUs (KAtiMon)</b><br/>"
"<br/>"
"Dit is en KDE-Programm, mit dat sik en poor Egenschappen vun Dien ATI-Grafikkoort beluern un instellen laat.<br/>"
"KAtiMon lett sik mit en Klick op't Lüttbild binnen den Systeemafsnitt opmaken.<br/>"
"<br/>"
"<u>Beacht, dit Programm wöör NICH vun ATI/AMD schreven: stüer ATI un AMD bitte keen Fehlerberichten to.</u><br/>"
"</html>"

#. +> trunk
#: src/win.py:670
msgid ""
"<html>It seems that your graphics card does not have a fan, or that it is not possible to control it using the aticonfig tool.<br/>"
"The fan controlling and monitoring capability of this program has been disabled.<br/>"
"<br/>"
"If this is incorrect, please send a bug report.</html>"
msgstr ""
"<html>As't lett hett Dien Grafikkoort keen Püüster, oder he lett sik mit \"aticonfig\" nich stüern.<br/>"
"Dat Stüern un Beluern wöör utmaakt.<br/>"
"<br/>"
"Wenn dit verkehrt is, stüer bitte en Fehlerbericht loos.</html>"

